  "description": "Convert a positive integer to its corresponding Excel column title.",
  "target": 28,
  "pseudocode": "1: function convertToTitle(columnNumber) {\n2:   let result = '';\n3:   while (columnNumber > 0) {\n4:     columnNumber--;\n5:     result = String.fromCharCode(65 + (columnNumber % 26)) + result;\n6:     columnNumber = Math.floor(columnNumber / 26);\n7:   }\n8:   return result;\n9: }",
